window.products.push({"id":398104,"name":"Bamboo Fruit Basket - 2 Tier Wooden Fruit Bowl for Kitchen Counter - Farmhouse Decor Fruit Holder for Kitchen W/ Paring Knife - Good for the Earth, Be","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pympZigTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ETAR is a company with a passion for design, and dedicated to saving our planet one fewer carbon footprint at a time. COMBINING FUNCTIONALITY WITH STYLE Our bamboo fruit basket provides optimal air flow from all sides ensuring that your fruit & veggies remain fresher for longer. Capable of handling 7 lb in weight, the fruit bowl for kitchen counter is extremely sturdy and will not wobble. IMPORTANT INFORMATION: * Made from 100% Natural Bamboo - the world's most renewable material which poses no negative environmental impact * This wooden fruit basket is beautifully finished with no sharp edges and no splinters * Easy assembly - it takes just 5 minutes or less (screws are included) * With this set you receive a sharp and super-useful 8” (22cm) PARING KNIFE DIMENSIONS - the perfect size for your countertop or dresser 13 Width x 11 Height x 8.5 Depth (33.5 x 28 x 22 cm) MULTIFUNCTIONAL 2-TIER FARMERS’ CRATE Why limit yourself to using this fun storage solution in just one way. Use them together as a 2-tier storage basket or individually for multi-functional home storage. Here are just some of the other uses we’ve found for this fruit holder for kitchen: * Bottles & cans * Spices * Snacks * Storing cups & mugs or glasses * Toiletries - your makeup and toiletries will never be as convenient to find as they are here - bamboo is perfect to use in moist areas such as the bathroom * Toys * Craft Supplies & so much more For use: AT HOME * IN THE OFFICE * NURSERY * SCHOOL * BUSINESS (Will keep your coffee corner spanking clean) AN ORIGINAL & EXCITING GIFT Tiered fruit basket is the perfect housewarming and hostess gift, sure to be appreciated by all. BUY YOURS TODAY and receive your bonus 8” paring knife.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pympZigTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Etar","source_asin":"B09L6NZWMH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-398104","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L6NZWMH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L6NZWMH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":398105,"name":"Reward For Dealing With Idiots All Day Funny 15oz Crystal Stemless Wine Glass - Fun Wine Glasses with Sayings Gifts For Women, Her, Mom on Mother's Da","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pbgu1hQkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍷 Above the rest! Looking for that fancy yet affordable gift? Our Crystal wine glasses are worth every penny. Unlike most of our competitors, we use High Quality Crystal Glass for creating that luxury feeling in the comfort of your home. Imagine saying Cheers at a girl’s night in with these elegant yet durable Wine Glasses. Our Stemless glasses actually Clink! Making your vino experience even fancier because you deserve it! Our glasses offer that delicate feeling yet high durability. 🍷 QUALITY THAT LAST: Made from Premium smooth, scratch-resistant Top-Quality lead-free crystal glass for outstanding durability. The Reward For Dealing With Idiots All Day Design is printed on the glass with high grade eco-friendly ink. Our 15oz Crystal Wine Glass is the perfect gift, for engagements, Christmas, birthdays, wedding anniversary, Valentine’s Day, bride and groom, honeymoon, bachelorette party, bridal shower gift or any other cute reason you want to show appreciation. 🍷 We're calling it: Funny wine glasses are the new funny coffee mugs. Plain stemless glasses are boring; you and your friends need something with a little personality when drinking wine. Show your favorite wine lover you care—and understand their love of a big glass of red (white, rosé or even tequila)—with these hilarious, relatable glasses. Drinking wine out of a glass has never been so much fun! Be the hit of the party with this funny wine glass. 🍷DISHWASHER AND MICROWAVE SAFE: You can rest assured that the print on the Crystal Wine Glass will never peel or fade over the time, even under hot or cold temperatures. You can use them in the microwave and in the dishwasher. 🍷 SATISFACTION GUARANTEED & CAREFULLY PACKED: In order to achieve 100% Customer Satisfaction in 2017 we have changed our packaging to be more durable during shipping. Each item is carefully packed, so we can make sure you receive your order safely and in perfect condition. For any defects in the materials on any of our products we stand behind, please contact our fantastic customer service team. We will quickly find a solution for you. With Over 250,000 Satisfied Customers and growing!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pbgu1hQkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AW Fashions","source_asin":"B07T8K6G11","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-398105","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T8K6G11","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T8K6G11","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
