window.products.push({"id":398113,"name":"makerflo 30oz Skinny Tumbler With Lid And Straw, Stainless Steel Insulated Cup With Leak-Proof Lid, BPA-Free, Powder Coated For Crafting, Vinyl, Acryl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zbXLXixZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made of Stainless Steel and Environment-Friendly: Our Skinny Tumbler is made from high-quality 304 stainless steel, which is a safe and reliable choice for enjoying both hot and cold beverages without worrying about harmful chemicals infusing into your drinks. It's a healthy and eco-friendly choice to carry your beverages and is perfect for everyday use. Powder-Coated Finish for Engraving: The tumbler's powder-coated finish provides a smooth and durable surface perfect for engraving. It allows you to Add your name, logo or custom design your tumbler for a personalized touch. The tumblers can be customized using various methods like engraving, vinyl, epoxy, and more! However, These powder-coated tumbler is NOT for sublimation. Retains the Temperature of the Beverage: Our skinny tumbler is designed with advanced insulation technology that locks in the temperature of your beverages. It can keep your cold beverages chilled for 12 hours and your hot beverages steaming hot for 6+ hours, allowing you to enjoy refreshing cold beverages or piping hot coffee, tea, or cocoa, no matter the weather or the time of day. It’s also ‘sweat-free,’ ensuring you don’t have to deal with condensation and wet hands. Perfect for Everyday Use: These 20oz tumblers are versatile and practical accessories for anyone who enjoys carrying their favorite beverages. It features a reusable straw and a convenient, spill-proof lid that prevents leakage. Its compact size fits easily into most backpacks and car cup holders, making it the perfect accessory for daily commuting or road trips. Easy to Maintain: This skinny tumbler is durable, functional, and easy to clean and maintain. The stainless-steel construction resists stains and odors, making it easy to keep smelling fresh and looking new after every wash. Rinse it with soap and water, or toss it in the dishwasher for effortless cleaning. ADD TO CART now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zbXLXixZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"makerflo","source_asin":"B09ZPNX87T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-398113","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZPNX87T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZPNX87T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
