window.products.push({"id":398167,"name":"Jackforce LED Bathroom Mirror with Lights 24x36 inch, Backlit and Front Lit, Anti-Fog, Shatter-Proof, 3 Colors, Memory, Dimmable Lighted Bathroom Vani","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618hby63cRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Super Bright Dual-Lights & Anti-fog Function] Both front and backlits with 192 pc LED bulbs per meter (about 30% more than ordinary LED mirrors), makes this mirror supper bright. With anti-fog function makes this mirror clear enough for makeup, shave and your beauty care! [Dimmable & Color Changeable] Long press the brightness button to change light intensity from normal to brightest. Short touch the color button to change your light color temperature: Warm(3000K), natural (4000K) and white(6000K). [Shatter-Proof & Corrosion Proof] 5mm Copper Free Strong Tempered Glass with Epoxy Coating, makes our mirror not easy to broke, safer to use, shatter proof and corrosion proof. [Easy-Installation] Two installation methods, which can be installed horizontally or vertically according to your needs. [Wall Switch or Plug in Support] Using wall switch or connecting to plug are both available. It is easy to install - just fix the mirror holders on the wall by screws and hang the mirror on those holders. Plugs and hardwares are included. [Sturdy Packaging & Satisfaction Guarantee] Our packages are upgrated and after testing before we ship out. We also provide 3 years warranty, if you have any doubts and questions, please feel free to contact us. We want to hear from your recommendation for improvement and we aim to let you have beautiful and safe mirrors! [Tips:] If you want to turned off the blue lights of the control buttons, just long-press the botton till it off.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618hby63cRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jackforce","source_asin":"B0B6DY8ZMR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-398167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6DY8ZMR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6DY8ZMR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
