window.products.push({"id":398351,"name":"SXNING High Stretch Spandex Coffee Tub Sofa Armchair Seat Cover Protector Washable Furniture Slipcover Easy-Install Home Chair Decor (Wine Red)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31V+QZf4AOL._AC_.jpg","description":"Form Fit Stretch - Made of two-way stretch knit that will follow the contours of your furniture. Smart seam details and elastic bottoms help create a custom, reupholstered look. The elastic is free-floating inside the hem of the cover to allow you to adjust fullness around the perimeter of your furniture. Create an instant, modern fitted look that matches that of more expensive upholstery. Easy to put on and very conformable to sit on.  PERFECT FIT: This stylish tub chair cover is crafted from durable and soft high stretch knitted jacquard fabric. Feature one-size-fits-most, easy to put on and off, just tuck the extra fabric into the gap between the back and sitting area to get refresh visual effect  SUPER STRETCH: These chshion covers are made of 90% polyester 10% spandex fabric with small checks jacquard pattern. Super soft and stretchy, anti-wrinkle and long lasting, give your furniture a fresh new look and will add style and elegance for your room  NON SLIP: Install from the backside and making sure it covers the entire item, then move the cover down slowly to fit over and insure proper fit (guide photos on selling page), it has elastic bottom for keeping in place firmly, feature one-size-fits-most  FULL PROTECT: Dress up your furniture with our jacquard cover to add aesthetic and vibrant sense for your room. It can protect your furniturn from spills, stains and scratches, while still add luxurious and charming feeling. Great for homes with children and pets  EASY CARE: Machine washable for easy care and maintenance, wash separately in cold water at gentle cycle, using mild laundry detergent, do not bleach and iron. We provide 30-day return and replacement service，our customers can get 100% satisfaction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31V+QZf4AOL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SXNING","source_asin":"B08Q3KKWTK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-398351","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Q3KKWTK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Q3KKWTK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
