window.products.push({"id":398355,"name":"ADO Basics Wicker Basket with Stain Resistant Wooden Handles, Seagrass Wicker Baskets for organizing 14.6inchx10.5inchx5.3inch and 13inchx7.4inchx5.1i","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cNHbYQYWS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Sustainable Home Storage Solution with Classic Stylish Decorative Look For Any Room and Outdoor-Ultimate Stylish Storage Solution - Build with natural seagrass, stylish Gold metal label, Stain Resistant Wooden handles and strong wireframe underneath; our decorative storage baskets add a natural charm to any room while providing a durable organization solution to multiple storage needs.-Portable and Durable: Decorative Woven Basket Wooden handles allow easy pick up for an instant move. Easy grab from Stain Resistant Wooden handles enables you to store on top of the dressers, closet or cabinet. Sturdy handles and a strong metal frame allow you to pull them down easily from an upper shelf.-Maximize: Use of Your Living Space. Store your essential stuff in stackable baskets inside the cupboard, table, countertop or floor. Use our baskets for organizing.-Basket Uses: This seagrass basket is used for kids toys, paper hand towels for guest bathroom, toilet paper basket, basket for gifts, decorative baskets for storage, kitchen basket, empty baskets for gifts, bread baskets for kitchen counter, guest bathroom decor, decorative baskets for home decor, bathroom counter decor, wicker laundry basket, a makeup basket, bedroom, inside cabinets, bookshelf decor, cupboard or countertops also can be used as storage baskets for shelves, Baskets for gifts empty.Use Information: 1- There is grassy smell when you unpack them. If you dont like the natural smell, air out under sun. 2- Use a damp cloth and wipe gently for cleaning.Each natural wicker storage basket is handcrafted, please make allowances for slight variations, which adds uniqueness to each basket look.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cNHbYQYWS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ADO Basics","source_asin":"B09751MHK5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-398355","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09751MHK5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09751MHK5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
