window.products.push({"id":398428,"name":"SKAHII Foil and Plastic Wrap Organizer with Cutter - 3 IN 1 Food Foil Dispenser with 3 Roll Plastic Food Wrap, Kitchen Bamboo Box Compatible with 12''","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81asGlqwNwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made of natural renewable bamboo, the surface is sealed with paint, finely polished by hand, strong and durable. We all know that family life, food and veggies fresh-keeping are inseparable from plastic wrap, the reasonable distribution of cling wrap could not leave the slide cutter. So, we designed this new type of food wrap dispenser. It combines storage and cutting 2 functions. The plastic wrap dispenser with a two-way sliding cutter can quickly and neatly cut. Open the box cover and place the film into the cutting tube, Press the adjustment lever, Pull the wrap to the desired length, then pull/push the cutter button from left or right to cut the food wrap neatly. Compared with the traditional plastic wrap box, our plastic wrap dispenser is more stable during use and is not easy to fall. The organizers are made specifically for your wraps and foils! Make your drawer neat and organized with this bamboo box.Not compatible with rolls that are wider than 12\". THOUGHTFUL PRESENT Our Foil Dispenser with Cutter is a great helper at home and can also be used in restaurants and cafeterias. Perfect as a gift for mother, girlfriend, and friends. Anyone who loves having their kitchen look tidy will be ecstatic to receive one of these plastic wrap storage rack cutters!  Foil and plastic wrap dispenser is made from eco-friendly bamboo, so it will never go out of style. Package Included: 1 * Bamboo 3 IN 1 Food Foil Dispenser 6 * plastic wax foil label stickers 3 * two-way sliding cutter 3 * plastic wax foil Food Wrap","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81asGlqwNwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SKAHII","source_asin":"B09VK76KQX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-398428","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VK76KQX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VK76KQX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
