window.products.push({"id":398622,"name":"Hipposama Tropical Plant Shower Curtain, Green Leaf Botanical Shower Curtain Set, Monstera Jungle Shower Curtains for Bathroom, Waterproof Fabric with","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CHwHJbr+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Tropical Plant Theme Design】This tropical leaf themed shower curtain makes bathing, which is inherently holy, more pure and natural. When you come to the bathroom covered in dust and tiredness, you will see a graceful green tropical leaf, and you must feel much refreshed. 【Water-repellent Eco-friendly & Bright Colors】State of the art digital printing technology vibrant colors, clear image, no fading. The durable waterproof material is friendly to the environment, no chemical smell. It can prevent water from splashing when you shower, shaping a dry and wet separation environment. 【Easy Installation & Dimensions】Tropical plant shower curtain sets comes with 12 rust-proof metal grommets and 12 rugged white hooks that are easy to install. 72\"x72\" size is fitting to all standard bathtubs and shower stalls, with either straight or angle shower rods. These rust-proof metal grommets prevent the tropical leaf shower curtain from tearing, ensuring better durability and a longer service life. 【Protect Privacy & Easy to Clean】It has been waterproof treatment, has a good waterproof, water droplets fall like pearls on the surface of the tropical botanical shower curtain, and will dry very soon after use. Superior ultra-thick polyester fabric delivers air permeability yet not see-through. So it guarantees a reassuring private space to well protect your privacy during bathes. 【Guaranteed for 100% Satisfaction】Feel free to reach out to us for any question about this green plant shower curtain. We provide you FREE REPLACEMENT or FULL REFUND guaranteed if you are not fully satisfied with the product you have received. Your satisfaction deserves our best attention. Order now, we can assure you this tropical jungle leaves shower curtain is the best choice that meets your expectation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CHwHJbr+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hipposama","source_asin":"B0C3H8R6KB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-398622","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3H8R6KB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3H8R6KB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":398623,"name":"Red Poppy III by Marion Rose, 24x32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":62.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UDwAIVApL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a light red flower in the center of the frame. Jai Johnson is a photographic artist living in West Tennessee who loves to spend her days in nature capturing life's most serene and peaceful moments, whether it be in landscapes, birds and wildlife, or the beauty of a simple flower. While her favorite subjects usually feature fur or feathers, rural country scenes and simple things also capture her photographic eye when she's behind the lens. When she's not out in nature capturing wildlife on camera, Jai spends her time in her studio transforming many of her original photographs into unique art by pairing them with hand-painted textures to create luxurious imagery filled with warmth, light, and color. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UDwAIVApL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B073ZMQZHQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-398623","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073ZMQZHQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073ZMQZHQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
