window.products.push({"id":398644,"name":"Panvola My Favorite Nephew Gave Me This Mug Gift To Uncle Auntie Mother's Day Father's Day New Aunt Funcle Ceramic Coffee Cup (11 oz)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IGHQiEUxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Self-Declared Favorite Nephew: They might have just forgotten, but you are their favorite. Remind your Aunts and Uncles that you are the one and there’s nothing they can do about it. It is clearly written! This drinkware will make your cousins jealous but will be an awesome item to bring laughter to every family reunion or special event. Premium Ceramic Coffee Mug: This high-quality ceramic mug has a premium hard coat that provides crisp and vibrant color reproduction sure to last for years. Printed on both sides for either left or right-handed person so the awesome message and art will be visible. High-gloss and has a premium finish that can make you enjoy your drink more. Can also be used as pen holders on your office work table, planter for your kitchen herb, jewelry holder, or serving your favorite dessert. Relatable Humorous Quote: Why settle for a boring old mug when you can have this one-of-a-kind drinkware on your dining, kitchen, or work table? Bring a smile to your loved ones' faces with this hilarious mug. Featuring a witty and relatable quote, this mug is sure to brighten anyone's day. Whether you're enjoying your morning coffee or taking a well-deserved break at work, this mug is the perfect pick-me-up. A conversation starter, it's also a surefire way to lift anyone's mood. Hilarious and Quirky Gift: It's not just the functional aspects that make this mug stand out. Its humorous design is what makes it a truly special and memorable gift. Whether it's to celebrate birthdays, anniversaries, graduation, holidays, retirement, Christmas, or any special milestone that occurs in life, this mug is sure to bring a smile to their face and some laughter to their day. The perfect present for anyone who loves a good laugh! Dishwasher and Microwave Safe: These fantastic drinking mugs can go straight in the dishwasher, all day every day, meaning it can save you time, and be more hygienic. Perfect for your favorite hot or cold beverages. Easily reheat that coffee or tea you forgot to drink right away because it is microwave safe. Saves you time, is very convenient, and is perfect for your busy lifestyle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IGHQiEUxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Panvola","source_asin":"B0BNSZZ2TY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-398644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNSZZ2TY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNSZZ2TY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":398645,"name":"mookaitedecor Rose Quartz Crystal Tree Tumbled Stones, Geode Agate Slices Base Money Tree Decoration for Wealth and Luck 5.7\"-6.7\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715jEoYGM4L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Total Height: 5.7\"-6.7\", Total Wide: 4.5\"-5.2\"(when open up the leaves); Size for crystal tree is approximately 5.9\"-6.3\" in height, 4.3\"-4.7\" in wide; Size for the natural agate slice base is approximately 2\"-2.7\"; Weight range from 55-85 grams; Comes with a grey velevt bag and a black box for gift ready. The base is made of natural agate slices, polished on both sides and geode inside. Agate slice base with a copper wire wrapped Rose Quartz Tree sculpture with crystal quartz leaves, secured to and growing out of the crystal, hand-twisted. We will fold up all branches and pack secured while packing. It need you to arrange the branch and leaves with your creativity and patience. The meaning on the Money Tree is \"Choi\" means \"Wealth\", Feng Shui\" and \"Luck\", also called \"Wishing Tree\". Idea for home decor or chakra crystal healing. This is a Feng shui bonsai tree to attract wealth and prosperity to your home or office, can also be used as a Christmas tree decoration. It helps increase energy, vitality and boosts mood. Agate is a good grounding stone, and has a strengthening and stabilizing energy that will help you in your daily tasks. Combined with the crystal tree, negative energy can be transferred into positive energy and keeps you energized and empowered, and makes you feel positive and uplifted. Comes with a velvet pouch, a wonderful gifts for you, your families and your friends, people who like to collect crystals and rocks. These crystal tree can be placed home, office or anywhere to create a strong healing vibration and clear the atmosphere of negative energies.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715jEoYGM4L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"mookaitedecor","source_asin":"B07PRRTBMS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-398645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PRRTBMS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PRRTBMS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
