window.products.push({"id":398649,"name":"Music Chime Box 002 Wall Clock Mechanism Clock Parts Melody Box with Horn DIY Clock Kits","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WlcE-00DL._AC_.jpg","description":"Name: Clock music box Size:66*55*16cm Box case material: Plastic Parts within Box material: Plastic Battery: one 1.5V Carbon-zinc batteries only,not included. Please DO NOT USE Alkaline battery,Rechargeable batteries,they will damage the movement. Movement Net Weight: 35g Place of Origin: GuangDong China (Mainland) Packing: Simple and Safe packing Parts:Music box and horn Characteristic: 4 kinds of Melody Used for: Prepair original clock,DIY clock This Music Box can be used when DIY Clock,it's a clock accessory. You can also use it to change your orriginal bad clock movement,this will save much money because you didn't need to repalce the whole clock For Battery This under current equipment fit 1.5V Carbon-zinc battery Only,Please Do not use high current batteries,rechargeable batteries,they will damage the movement. As we know,batteries has many limits on air transportation,in order to make shipping more smoothly,batteries didn't included in our package a)SET:Chime Time Setting Button(Red) After press one time\"SET\"button,the chime time will onward one hour,but after press one time\"SET\",The 4x4 mode will not work correctly during the first hour after time is set.However,after that,it works correctly. (Such as now is 10:25,the chime only will working on 11:00,it can not working during 10:25~10:59 this period) b)MODE:Melody select -AVE MARIA :Ave Maria + Striking at 00 min. -4x4 WESTMINSTER:Westminster + Striking at 00 min; 1/4,2/4,3/4 Westminster at 15,30 and 45 min respectively. -WESTMINSTER:Westminster + Strinking at 00 min. -BIM BAM:Bim Bam at 00 min. (e.g.:at 1 o'clock,1 strike of Bim Bam;at 2 o'clock,2 strikes of Bim Bam,ect.) (Note:The clock will switch off automatically from 10:00 PM to 5:59AM if the strike is set correctly.)  C)VOLUME:Rotary volume  This music box need to be used together with Trigger Movement","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WlcE-00DL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Music Box","source_asin":"B01MCYZ5DM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-398649","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MCYZ5DM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MCYZ5DM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":398650,"name":"TINCOKO Large Nonstick Frying Skillet Pan with Lid - 12.5\" Green Granite Coating Non-stick Omelet Pan, Die-Cast Aluminum Alloy Cookware, Non Toxic APE","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VHCK1JdGL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"LIVELY & ELEGANT GREEN DESIGN-TINCOKO'S granite coating wok & stir fry pan is designed with classy marble looking surface which is made out of all natural coating colors. The special-designed green color of deep frying skillet makes a bold style statement. 12.5 inch diameter large saute pan is the ideal size for a big family meals.It's really a nice-looking kitchen assistant. PREMIUM MATERIAL & SCRATCH RESISTANT-The frying pans nonstick are made of die casting aluminum alloy, which is comparatively light, you won't feel tired to move it when cooking. With a flat magnetized base, it conducts heat across all pan quickly and evenly, compatible with all stoves. Stone-drived coating built on aluminum alloy layer makes it ultra nonstick and easy to clean. You do not need to change the frying pan frequently, because this frying skillet set has good scratch resistance. ERGONOMIC HANDLES & HEAT RESISTED GLASS LID-Non sticking frying pan has ergonomic phenolic handle with wooden finish, excellent soft hand feeling and non-slip. It's heat insulation well and very comfortable to grip.The high-quality glass lid with vent holes, easy to observe the state of the dishes when cooking. The knob on the lid is designed to put on the spatula and spoon, you will not lose them when cooking. HEALTHY COOKING-Nonstick inside and outside makes easier water washing, achieve effortless cook a dish, wash a pan. 100% without APEO and POFA, as well as the little-known chemicals NMP and NEP, no risk of exposure to any chemicals. AFTER SALE SERVICE-TINCOKO cookware are manufactured under strict quality standards to satisfy every customer. We offer 30-day money-back guarantee and 12-month limited warranty. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VHCK1JdGL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TINCOKO","source_asin":"B09XTY6HBG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-398650","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XTY6HBG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XTY6HBG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":398651,"name":"ZICOOLER Bladeless Tower Fan and Air Purifier, 80° Oscillating Fan for Bedroom, 32 inch Standing Floor Fans with HEPA Filter 99.97%, Remote, Quiet Coo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.84,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OQQQvpZuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Leafless Design, No Assembly Required】 This desktop tower fan can provide fresh air without rotating blades, the leafless design will not hurt your baby and pet, it is an ideal summer must-have for families with children and pets. At the same time, this bladeless tower fan is transported as a whole machine, and it can be used immediately without your assembly, which saves you the trouble of installation. 【3 Layer Filters, 8 Wind Speed】 The effective combination of the fan and the air purifier, this air purifier fan meets the H11 HEPA standard. After 3-stage filtration, it can effectively filter out more than 99.7% of impurities in the air and the particle size is only 0.3 micron particles, purify the air to help relieve asthma and other allergies. From soft wind to strong wind, 8 wind speeds can be adjusted at will, taking care of different occasions and different users. 【Larger Size, 80° Swing】 Different from other products, our 32\" tower fan has a larger size and can guarantee a powerful airflow of 500 cubic meters per hour. This oscillating fan can achieve the best cooling effect when used with your air conditioner. With its 80° wide-angle vibration, it can bring cool air into your room faster and provides a continuous, fresh breeze in the hot summer to keep everyone in the room cool and comfortable. 【Lower Noise, Quiet Night】 Having a good sleep quality is extremely important! This bladeless fan is designed for ultra-quiet and smooth oscillation in sleep mode; the LED display automatically turns off after 5 seconds, and the 8H timer is activated at the same time, enabling you to enjoy 8 hours of deep sleep with a noise as low as 30dB. Quiet and wonderful cool environment, do not disturb every sweet dream. 【Smart Remote Control, Excellent Service】 Our tower fan come with wireless remote control, which can control the machine from a very long distance, you can easily control all functions (wind speed, timer, oscillation, etc.) without getting up. We provide 24 hours online service, if you have any questions, please feel free to contact us, our customer service team will be happy to assist you. 【Genuine Replacement Filters】 Search \"B09JSMRRHZ\" on Amazon. The replacement filter should be replaced about 6 months depending on the air quality in your area.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OQQQvpZuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZICOOLER","source_asin":"B0C2V3DYWB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-398651","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2V3DYWB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2V3DYWB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":398652,"name":"HOMCOM 28\" Set of 2 Swivel Bar Height Bar Stools, Armless Upholstered Barstools Chairs with Soft Padding Cushion and Wood Legs, Light Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":251.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bHv9r1dFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Set of 2 Bar Stools: Create your breakfast bar with this barstool set! Finally, you can have a quiet spot to comfortably socialize. Swivel Seat: Love turning side to side? No problem, the swivel seat ensures 360° rotation, you can turn to your friends or television without getting up. Tall Bar Chairs: Our bar stool with 28.5\" seat height is designed to give you a good view, great in high kitchen counters and home bars with a countertop of 41\"-43\". Cushioned Seat: The bar stool has a spring and elastic webbed seat for a cushioned support system to provide a more supportive and relaxing sitting experience. The cushion has a high-density foam, which provides extra comfort. Bar Chairs Dimensions: 18\" W x 20.75\" D x 41\" H; Weight Capacity: 264 lbs. Assembly Required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bHv9r1dFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMCOM","source_asin":"B09PR54PPS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-398652","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PR54PPS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PR54PPS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
