window.products.push({"id":398654,"name":"Ornavo Home Soft Plush & Fuzzy Throw Sherpa Lined Fleece Bed Blanket & Couch - Reversible & All Seasons - Queen, 90\" W x 90\" L, Chocolate Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vO2QW96CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You may have the perfect bed décor but if you're missing soft, cozy blankets, your bed room is simply not complete. Not only are throw blankets great for keeping you and your guests warm, they can also serve as gorgeous decor when used as a statement piece. At Ornavo Home, you’re guaranteed to love the quality, feel and look of this reversible velvet/sherpa blanket. SOFT AND PLUSH: With its ultra soft and plush material, it’s the ideal combination of warm, cozy, lightweight and soft for all-season enjoyment. Use it as a layering piece under your quilt during the winter or pair it with just your top sheet when the weather warms up. SUPERIOR QUALITY: Well-crafted for durability and style, this blanket incorporates a crisp stripe pattern that lends unique texture and charm, and is perfect for use all year-round. REVERSIBLE: The front of this blanket is made entirely of velvet while the reverse is entirely polyester sherpa, a thick fabric that is made of polyester but resembles sheepskin. ALL SEASON: Made of 100% premium polyester, this versatile blanket is light enough to use in spring, fall, or summer and is perfect for layering on cold nights. MACHINE WASHABLE: Toss it in the washing machine for easy cleaning, and pull it out with no worries about lint.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vO2QW96CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ORNAVO HOME","source_asin":"B07C2CWM8V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-398654","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C2CWM8V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C2CWM8V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
