window.products.push({"id":398933,"name":"BIARTS Trash Can Kitchen Trash Can Compost Tumbler Bin Countertop Garbage Can Bathroom Hanging with Lid Small Rv Wall Hanging Compost Bin Diaper Plast","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611eo5whGsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1, ✅【Non-Bend Over】If you are looking for trash can hanging that could avoid the hassle of bending back and forth when cooking, BIATRS small hanging trash can with lid can solve this problem. The widened-diameter food waste bin for kitchen can be hung on the cabinet (Thinkness<0.86 in, suitable for 98% cabinet on the market), you can pour the fruit and vegetable waste directly into the hanging waste basket, very convenient. 2, ✅【Space Saver】BIARTS small hanging trash can with lid can avoid moving the food scrap bin here and there when cleaning the floor, and prevent troublemakers from knocking over the food waste bin for kitchen. Our hanging waste basket is ideal for kitchen, bathroom, washroom, RV, laundry, etc. It can save much space, and the airtight trash can is smell/baby/dog/cat proof. 3, ✅【3 Ways of Use】1, Our small hanging trash can with lid can hang over the cabinet doors, pantry doors, cupboard, or under sink with over-the-door-hook without punching. 2, Mounted the hanging waste basket on the wall in the kitchen/bathroom/laundry room with adhesive tape. 3, Just put the food waste bin for kitchen on the countertop for usage. 4, ✅【Non-odor Compost Bin】BIARTS food scrap bin also a very handy indoor compost bin if you're a gardener. This small hanging trash can with lid designed specifically as a hidden non-smelling fruit fly free. No odor and no waste of charcoal filter need for the food waste bin for kitchen. There is a hook on the lid of the hanging waste basket, which can be hung on the trash can when it is opened. 5, ✅【Satisfaction Guaranteed】Product Size: 8.3\"L x 6.9\"W x 9.6\"H , Capacity 1.3 Gallons/5L. Made of PP and ABS, durable, our small hanging trash can with lid can last for years. Please make sure this food waste bin for kitchen is the size you need before purchasing. Your satisfaction is our priority and We value every suggestion of our customers. If you have any issues with our hanging waste basket, please feel free to contact us and we will reply to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611eo5whGsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BIARTS","source_asin":"B0BRKRCKL1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-398933","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRKRCKL1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRKRCKL1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
