window.products.push({"id":398950,"name":"Automatic Touchless Foam Soap Dispenser Infrared Motion Sensor Liquid Electric Soap Dispenser Waterproof for Bathroom Bathroom Kitchen Toilet Office H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QL-unFpeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Full Automatic & Touchless】Touchless foaming soap dispenser, built-in precise infrared motion and PIR sensor detection technology. Just put your hand under the sensor area to start the soap dispenser, so as to avoiding cross infection effectively. High sensitivity ,let you can get the soap liquid quickly in 0.2 seconds. 【Anti-Oxidation Material & Low Power Consumption】The hands free soap dispenser is use High Quality & Durable Anti-Oxidation Material，It can effectively avoid rust and water from corroding circuit boards.Enhanced motor power offer more stable quantity of produced liquid.Environmental Protection and Low Power Consumption Design,Can effectively extend product Working life and recycle use. 【Silicone Anti-slip Mat & Simple Easy to Use】The foaming soap dispenser is equipped with anti-slip base.Take it down can also be used as a funnel. Convenient for you to quickly pour liquid into the soap dispenser.This foaming soap dispenser automatic is so easy to use, children get the foam to wash hands effortless. 【Wide Application & Multiple Compatibility】Suitable for All Kinds of Liquid Soap,Such as bath soap liquid,dish soap Liquid,body lotion,shampoo,facial cleanser and hand soap.which can be mixed with 1 to 3 times water.The Maximum Capacity is 300ml. This soap dispenser is wide use for kitchen, bathroom, hotel, restaurant, school,Toilet,Office,hospital etc. 【Adjustable Soap Volume】Adjust the volume of the dispensing liquid soap as per requirement. You can simply use the multi-function keys(ON+/OFF-) on top to accordingly regulate the amount of soap.It is our greatest desire and pleasure to offer you our Excellent Service and Best After-Sales Support. If you have any questions,please feel free to contact our team, we will provide solutions within 24 hours. 【Warm Tips】If there is no pump out foam, please check whether the duct is blocked. Do not put too viscous liquid, Must be mixed with water in proportion.We offers a Money Back Guarantee if you're not satisfied with our product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QL-unFpeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Newland","source_asin":"B08HYV532W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-398950","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HYV532W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HYV532W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":398951,"name":"Chess & Checkers Folding Magnetic Travel Set - 12.5\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51d23qPDrGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Our medium size Chess and Checkers Folding Magnetic Travel Set is a high quality plastic chess set that is perfect for taking on trips whether it's on a long vacation or just to school and back. You'll find this size light and portable and can be easily stored away in a suitcase or backpack yet large enough for a good game of chess anywhere. The chess pieces are nicely detailed and have strong magnets underneath that are recessed so they do not touch the chess board to prevent scratching it up over time. The pieces will stay put and you can even turn the board upside down and they won't fall off. The case folds in half to hold the pieces inside and securely snaps closed and won't open up until you want it open. The chess board features algebraic notation on all sides, a nice feature that most travel sets don't have. Some advantages that our plastic travel chess set has over wood is that it's weather proof and it won't crack or warp like wood travel chess sets can do over time. It's much lighter in weight and more durable than wood and the board is screen printed metal so it has better magnetic properties compared to a wood surface with a metal sheet underneath. Overall, we believe this is an unbeatable travel chess set at breakthrough price that you'll truly enjoy! Includes 32 Chess & 24 Checker Pieces (checkers are not magnetic) Closed Dimensions: 12.5\" x 6.25\" x 1.5\" Open Dimensions: 12.5\" x 12.5\" x .75\" Square Size: 1.375\" King Height: 2.625\" King Base: 1\" Chess Set Weight: 28 oz. Includes basic game instructions","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51d23qPDrGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Chess Store","source_asin":"B0084HM3TW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-398951","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0084HM3TW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0084HM3TW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":398952,"name":"1InTheOffice Bookends for Shelves, Heavy Duty Black Metal L-Shaped Bookends, Non Skid, (3 Pairs)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61J-EgLgrmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Say Goodbye to messy desks and shelves! Do you love collecting books, movies, and CD’s, but need a way to keep all of them more organized and stop them from falling over onto each other?  Have you tried using large and intrusive stands and paperweights that either slide around or take up too much room on your shelves?  ,b> 1InTheOffice Heavy Duty Bookend Stand is your answer! For all of us bookworms or movie lovers out there, we know that keeping our self-space nice and organized is an absolute must, especially when we’re always adding new additions to our collections. Having a messy bookcase or cabinet doesn’t just look bad, but can also put strain and wear onto your shelves, books, movies, and CD’s, causing irreversible damage to them and possibly causing you to buy replacements.  That’s why using a lightweight, yet durable and heavy-duty Bookend is necessary in making sure your favorite physical media stays in tip-top shape and well organized so you don’t spend hours looking for ones you may have lost or misplaced in all of the clutter. With our Bookends, you can restore order and cleanliness to your shelves and bookcase once again, making them presentable to guests, friends, and family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61J-EgLgrmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"1InTheOffice","source_asin":"B07RKYP5DQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-398952","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RKYP5DQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RKYP5DQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
